# lib/

Framework-agnostic primitives for ${PROJECT_NAME}. **No imports from
`screens/`, `navigation/`, `features/`, or `api/`.**

| File | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| [`storage.ts`](storage.ts) | Typed wrapper around `@react-native-async-storage/async-storage`. |

## Guard rails

- Functions in this folder must be testable in pure Node — no React, no
  Navigation, no Expo-specific globals at the module top level.
- Add tests under [`${SRC_DIR}/tests/unit/`](../tests/) when adding logic
  here.

